  "setResetTitle": "Reset your identity?",
  "setResetBody": "This creates a brand-new identity (new encryption and signing keys).\n\n• Your contacts will see you as a new, unverified person and must verify your new safety number.\n• Messages still travelling towards your old identity can no longer be read.\n• Messages waiting to be sent are discarded.\n• You can no longer take part in your groups (they know your old identity); your copies of those chats stay on this phone.\n• Your existing chats stay on this phone.\n\nThis cannot be undone.",
